{{/* ---- Never install dependency or build trees ----
     chezmoi does not read .gitignore, so a node_modules left by an install under
     dot_config/hunk/extensions is walked as target content. It reads filenames as
     its own attributes, and typebox's build/type/engine/readonly_object/ collides
     with the sibling object/ directory — which aborts every chezmoi command on
     this source with "inconsistent state" and an empty result.
*/}}
